+Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Laughs{\i0}
+Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I'm so excited my glasses are falling off here.
